      "desc": "The driving modes, for the player only. wall is the speed kept hitting the Armco square on, grass the grass for that mode. brake is the share of grip the brake aid lets you carry into a corner before it brakes for you: under 1 it keeps you inside the grip, over 1 it steps in only when you are well over it, 0 is off. guard steers you off the Armco: it looks look seconds ahead and starts within margin metres of the wall, gain is how firmly, brake how hard it brakes when the turn back needs more grip than there is. Expert is the race's own grass and Armco with no aids." },
